  "subTitleDesc": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CE03310",
    "sub_id": "31109",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "sub_title": "本課程介紹高齡化趨勢及其對環境設計的影響",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "本課程探討現行高齡宜居設計現況、不足與國際高齡友善環境案例。學生將學習通用設計、無障礙環境與健康促進概念，並透過各國案例分析與討論，培養評估與規劃高齡宜居環境的基礎能力，為未來設計實務奠定基礎。",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "高齡宜居環境營造",
    "sub_ename": "CREATING HEALTHY & LIVABLE ENVIRONMENTS FOR AGING POPULATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹高齡化趨勢及其對環境設計的影響，探討現行設計的不足與國際高齡友善環境案例。學生將學習通用設計、無障礙環境與健康促進概念，並透過案例分析與討論，培養評估與規劃高齡宜居環境的基礎能力，為未來設計實務奠定基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces aging trends and their impact on environmental design, exploring current design shortcomings and international age-friendly environment case studies. Students will learn concepts of universal design, accessible environments, and health promotion. Through case analysis and discussions, they will develop fundamental skills in evaluating and planning aging-friendly environments, laying a foundation for future design practices.",
